            <ArticleTitle>Burkitt's lymphoma of the ovary.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>104-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two cases of a unilateral ovarian Burkitt's lymphoma are presented. One patient is 32 years and the other 15 years old. The case report highlight the clinical presentation and differential diagnosis of unilateral ovarian Burkitt's lymphoma in adults.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
